      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:martyrdoms.victor.budge:33-48",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲧⲟⲧⲉ ⲏⲣⲱⲇⲏⲥ ⲁϥⲙⲟⲩϯ ⲉⲛⲓ**ⲙⲁⲅⲟⲥ** ⲛⲭⲱⲡ ⲁϥϧⲟⲧϧⲉⲧ ⲛⲧⲟⲧⲟⲩ ⲛⲥⲁⲡⲓⲥⲏⲟⲩ ⲛⲧⲉⲡⲓⲥⲓⲟⲩ ⲉⲧⲁϥⲟⲩⲱⲛϩ .",
      "english": "Then Herod secretly called the wise men, and learned from them exactly what time the star appeared.",
      "source": "01_Matthew_02",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.matt.bohairic:02",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲧⲟⲧⲉ ⲡ**ⲙⲁⲅⲟⲥ** ⲡⲉϫⲁϥ ·",
      "english": "Then the magician said,",
      "source": "Martyrdom of Victor part 7",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:martyrdoms.victor.budge:67-85",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
